    "detailed_description": "<u>Please note: RELO is still in development, so screenshots don't show the final game.</u><br><br>RELO is a puzzle programming game where you use trains to solve problems they really weren't meant for.<br><br><strong>Highlights:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Discover and master an unconventional train-based logic system.<br></li><li> Explore programming concepts presented in a whole new physical way. (Who knew a for-loop would be an <i>actual</i> loop!)<br></li><li> Unlock a variety of parts to solve even the most complex challenges.<br></li><li> Get your solution working without limitations, or optimize your solutions for speed, cost, or both!<br></li><li> Enjoy a minimalist cute aesthetic and smooth animations</li></ul>",
